<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Leviathan raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Leviathan raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it raised the rating Leviathan Gas Pipeline Partners LP to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- analysts Ron Barone and James Yannello said they believe the partnership's strong fundamentals and strong cash flows will enable it to continue to frequently raise distribution payments during 1997 and 1998, projecting at least two increases this year and more to follow in 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at $20 on Friday.</p>
</text>
